        <p className="arabic-font text-emerald-800 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-3" dir="rtl">
           لَعَلَّكُمْ تَتَّقُونَ
        </p>
        <p className="text-slate-500 text-[11px] font-medium leading-relaxed italic opacity-80">
           "...that you may become righteous." (Qur'an 2:183)
        </p>
      </div>
